<title>SWEDEN: Swedish reverse repo drains 39 bln SKR from market.</title>
<headline>Swedish reverse repo drains 39 bln SKR from market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, on Tuesday said it drained 39 billion crowns from the market in the morning's reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed 4.35 percent, as expected, and will run from December 11 to December 18, replacing an operation that drained 36.5 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 9.22 percent of bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
